{"assets":["/statement-assets/ab86f4c846e834a7aa7351e49a278bf00944eb210dcc4b500630f49ab69b9ef2.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"494","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Birthday"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ali is Hamed's little brother and tomorrow is his birthday. Hamed wants his brother to earn his gift so he gave him a hard programming problem and told him if he can successfully solve it, he'll get him a brand new laptop. Ali is not yet a very talented programmer like Hamed and although he usually doesn't cheat but this time is an exception. It's about a brand new laptop. So he decided to secretly seek help from you. Please solve this problem for Ali. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":"-vertex weighted rooted tree is given. Vertex number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a root of the tree. We define "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d(u, v)"},{"kind":"text","text":" as the sum of edges weights on the shortest path between vertices "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":". Specifically we define "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d(u, u) = 0"},{"kind":"text","text":". Also let's define "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"S(v)"},{"kind":"text","text":" for each vertex "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"v"},{"kind":"text","text":" as a set containing all vertices "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"u"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d(1, u) = d(1, v) + d(v, u)"},{"kind":"text","text":". Function "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f(u, v)"},{"kind":"text","text":" is then defined using the following formula:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/ab86f4c846e834a7aa7351e49a278bf00944eb210dcc4b500630f49ab69b9ef2.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The goal is to calculate "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f(u, v)"},{"kind":"text","text":" for each of the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" given pair of vertices. As the answer can be rather large it's enough to print it modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"109 + 7"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line of input an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":"), number of vertices of the tree is given."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines three space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai, bi, ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai, bi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ci ≤ 109"},{"kind":"text","text":") are given indicating an edge between "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bi"},{"kind":"text","text":" with weight equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the next line an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ q ≤ 105"},{"kind":"text","text":"), number of vertex pairs, is given."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In each of the next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ui, vi"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ui, vi ≤ n"},{"kind":"text","text":") are given meaning that you must calculate "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f(ui, vi)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the given edges form a tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"q"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines. In the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th line print the value of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"f(ui, vi)"},{"kind":"text","text":" modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"109 + 7"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n1 2 1\n4 3 1\n3 5 1\n1 3 1\n5\n1 1\n1 5\n2 4\n2 1\n3 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10\n1000000005\n1000000002\n23\n1000000002\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8\n1 2 100\n1 3 20\n2 4 2\n2 5 1\n3 6 1\n3 7 2\n6 8 5\n6\n1 8\n2 3\n5 8\n2 6\n4 7\n6 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"999968753\n49796\n999961271\n999991235\n999958569\n45130\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"494D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/494/problem/D"}